  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Sometimes the best runs begin after the finish line fades. The Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA9 is built to carry you beyond expectations. Featuring a sleek design with textile, leather, and plastic accents, these shoes channel the bold spirit of Y2K style. The snappy and responsive Air Zoom cushioning keeps you feeling light on your feet and offers a smooth ride. Your go-to for depth, durability, and easy styling, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA9 lets you carve a new lane for yourself.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA9 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Real and synthetic leather upper adds durability.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side offers support.</li> <li>Reflective details provide visibility in low-light conditions.</li> <li>Rubber outsole ensures durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that keeps up and a look that works far beyond the gym. The Nike Zoom Vomero 5 blends a cushioned, easygoing ride with layered Y2K-inspired design, making it a go-to for walking, commuting, errands, and everyday wear. Reflective details add a standout finish and are not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><ul><li>Textile upper with real and synthetic leather overlays for breathable durability.</li><li>Plastic side caging adds lightweight support and the signature Vomero 5 look.</li><li>Air Zoom cushioning delivers a smooth, responsive feel underfoot.</li><li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction for daily miles.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say it fits true to size. For the best fit, we recommend choosing your usual size, while shoppers who prefer a little extra room in the forefoot or have wider feet may prefer a half-size up.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for daily wear, city walking, travel days, and light workouts when all-day comfort matters.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently call out how easy this pair is to dress up or down. The layered runner look pairs naturally with leggings, jeans, shorts, and more, giving you a sporty staple that moves easily from workouts and errands to everyday outfits.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say comfort starts right away, with many noting little to no break-in before all-day wear. The lightweight build and durable outsole help keep it in regular rotation, and repeat buyers often come back for multiple pairs.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA9 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Summit White/Hyper Pink</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IM2404-645</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 37.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 38</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-al